<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000003> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "(Elucidation) An occurrent is an entity that unfolds itself in time or it is the start or end of such an entity or it is a temporal or spatiotemporal region"@en .
