<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000040> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "An independent continuant that is spatially extended whose identity is independent of that of other entities and can be maintained through time."@en .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000040> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "material entity"@en .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000040> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "(Elucidation) A material entity is an independent continuant has some portion of matter as continuant part"@en .
# 
# http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000140
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000140> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
