<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000000> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Material"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000000> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "material"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000000> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A material is a portion of matter that may participate in some manufacturing process and whose shape is not relevant for its participation in the manufacturing process."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000001
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
