<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000001> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "portion of matter"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000001> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A material entity that is not demarcated by any physical discontinuities. At some finer level of granularity it is an object aggregate, at some coarser level of granularity it is a fiat object part,but at this level of granularity it is neither."@en .
