<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000068> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "temporally qualified continuant"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000068> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A temporally qualified continuant is a continuant that, by reference to a determinate temporal region, is such as to possess its properties only for so long as that period obtains, being otherwise in its essentiality unchanged."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000110
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000110> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000110> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000015> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000110> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "geological process"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000110> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A natural process that operates within the Earth system to transform, transport, or deform Earth materials, thereby changing Earth structures and landforms"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000520
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000520> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000520> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000015> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000520> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Wärmefluss"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000520> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "heat flow"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000520> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "is a process in which transfer of thermal energy between or within material entities occurs"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000520> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "ist ein Prozess, bei dem Wärmeenergie zwischen oder innerhalb materieller Einheiten übertragen wird"@de .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000553
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000553> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000553> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080116> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000553> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "chemical potential"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000553> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "chemisches Potential"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000553> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "a quality of a thermodynamic system describing the energy change associated with the addition of a small quantity of a substance to a system at constant temperature and pressure."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000553> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "eine intensive Qualität eines thermodynamischen Systems, die die Energieänderung beschreibt, die mit der Zugabe einer kleinen Menge einer Substanz zu einem System bei konstanter Temperatur und konstantem Druck verbunden ist."@de .
