<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0010026> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "organic composition"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0010026> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "organische Zusammensetzung"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0010026> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A composition characterized by a primary molecular structure of carbon atoms covalently bonded to hydrogen (C-H bonds), typically forming linear, branched, or networked chains."@en .
# 
