<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020101> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Anteil"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020101> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "proportion"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020101> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A proportion is a relational quality between two entities (the whole and the part) which quantifies the relation between the whole and its part."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020102
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020102> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020102> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080069> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020102> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Massenverhältnis"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020102> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "mass ratio"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020102> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Das Massenverhältnis bezeichnet eine relationale Qualität, die einen Massenwert im Verhältnis zu einem anderen ausdrückt und typischerweise eine dimensionslose Zahl ergibt"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020102> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Mass ratio denotes a relational quality expressing one mass value relative to another, typically producing a dimensionless number"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020103
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020103> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020103> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080069> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020103> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Molverhältnis"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020103> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "molar ratio"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020103> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Der Molanteil ist der Anteil, der die Anzahl der Einheiten des Teils im Verhältnis zur Anzahl der Einheiten des Ganzen quantifiziert."@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020103> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Molar proportion is the proportion which quantifies the entities count of the part in relation to the entities count of the whole."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020104
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020104> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020104> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080069> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020104> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Volumenverhältnis"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020104> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "volume ratio"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020104> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Volume ratio represents a relational quality expressing one volume value relative to another, typically resulting in a dimensionless number"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020104> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Volumenverhältnis stellt eine relationale Qualität dar, die einen Volumenwert im Verhältnis zu einem anderen ausdrückt, typischerweise resultierend in einer dimensionslosen Zahl"@de .
