<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020200> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "force"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020200> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A force is an entity that consists of a reciprocal interaction between two objects and is realized as equal and opposite influences capable of changing motion or causing deformation."@en .
